-- The Noise (working title "Szum") - main storyline for a loner starting in the Cordon village.
-- Replaces Fanatic's "Training Day". Prefix: szm_
--
-- Prologue  1      : a garbled PDA message, Sid's lost courier
-- Act I     2-6    : Cordon, Sid's lessons (bandit, boars, Jellyfish + first Hum, campfire with Wolf), go to Spore
-- Act II    7-12   : Great Swamp, Spore's jobs, Cold, the helicopter wreck
-- Act III   13-15  : Sid decrypts the flight recorder, Garbage, the dead convoy in Agroprom
-- Act IV    16     : who gets the Kamerton: Cold, Sid or Wolf (destroy it); epilogue a day later
--
-- Every stage: offer dialog -> task stage 0 (objective) -> task stage 1 (report) -> turn-in dialog -> rewards
-- The next stage is offered only after the previous one has been turned in.

---------------------------< Spawn areas >---------------------------
